mareader-vits ports the inference half of VITS, as Piper trains and exports
it, to Rust and candle.

The port follows Piper's training code (https://github.com/rhasspy/piper,
src/python/piper_train/vits): the text encoder with relative attention, the
stochastic duration predictor and its spline flows, the coupling flow and the
HiFi-GAN generator. Piper is MIT-licensed:

